m/company-profile/","https://www.msx.om/MSMDOCS/FinancialReports/SSPW_2026_Q3%20%28Un-Audited%29_e.zip"],"overviewGeneratedAt":"2026-11-20","highlights":["Secured a new 10-year PWPA and matching NGSA running April 2027 to April 2037 with upgraded contracted capacity of 465 MW power and 15 MiGD water.","Fully repaid its term loan ahead of maturity on 30 June 2026, slashing total liabilities by ~37% to OMR 39.5M and reducing gearing to zero.","FY2025 Financial Snapshot: Revenue of OMR 83.94M and Net Profit of OMR 23.29M (Total Assets: OMR 244.94M).","Ownership Registry (mcd.om): 1,791 registered shareholders • Omani 57.8% | GCC 1.2% | Foreign & Arab 41.1% (3 disclosed 5%+ holders)."],"segments":[{"name":"Salalah IWPP (Contracted Power & Water)","pct":100.0,"summary":"Integrated gas-fired combined-cycle electricity generation and reverse osmosis seawater desalination sold exclusively to PWP under a long-term PWPA.","color":"bg-indigo-500"}],"segmentMode":"verified_pct","segmentNote":"Single-Asset PWPA Utility (100%)","series":{"dates":["Nov 23, '25","Nov 24, '25","Nov 25, '25","Nov 30, '25","Dec 01, '25","Dec 02, '25","Dec 03, '25","Dec 04, '25","Dec 07, '25","Dec 09, '25","Dec 10, '25","Dec 11, '25","Dec 14, '25","Dec 15, '25","Dec 16, '25","Dec 17, '25","Dec 18, '25","Dec 21, '25","Dec 22, '25","Dec 23, '25","Dec 24, '25","Dec 25, '25","Dec 28, '25","Dec 29, '25","Dec 30, '25","Dec 31, '25","Jan 01, '26","Jan 04, '26","Jan 05, '26","Jan 06, '26","Jan 07, '26","Jan 08, '26","Jan 11, '26","Jan 12, '26","Jan 13, '26","Jan 14, '26","Jan 19, '26","Jan 20, '26","Jan 21, '26","Jan 22, '26","Jan 25, '26","Jan 26, '26","Jan 27, '26","Jan 28, '26","Jan 29, '26","Feb 02, '26","Feb 04, '26","Feb 05, '26","Feb 08, '26","Feb 09, '26","Feb 10, '26","Feb 11, '26","Feb 12, '26","Feb 15, '26","Feb 16, '26","Feb 17, '26","Feb 18, '26","Feb 19, '26","Feb 22, '26","Feb 23, '26","Feb 24, '26","Feb 25, '26","Feb 26, '26","Mar 01, '26","Mar 02, '26","Mar 03, '26","Mar 04, '26","Mar 05, '26"